Task: Add preferred_point and 2-D predict_at to BaseXApp

Changes:
- BaseXApp.predict_at(p1, p2=None) now evaluates the surrogate at an explicit
  2-D point; p2 defaults to the xApp's preferred p2 (not the dataset min).
- Supports k>2 features by fixing every ICP after the first at its preferred
  coordinate; raises ValueError if p2 is passed to a 1-ICP xApp.
- Replaced the old 'p2 held at observed constant' test with tests for the
  preferred-p2 default, explicit-p2 override, and untrained guards.
- Updated the synthetic baseline to the corrected interim 1-D result:
  with only p1 free and p2 preferred, neither app is satisfied (p*=-100.5017).

Why:
- Pinning p2 at the dataset minimum never exercised the real 2-D surface and
  made 'before' KPIs disagree with the xApp's own request.

Files: surrogate_xapps/xapps.py, tests/test_cmc.py, tests/test_cmc_baseline.py
